{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 45, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the land of the rising sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a Metropolis of Light**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive at Narita's gate.\nA taxi swift shall bear thee to thy lodging state.\nShinjuku's heights a dizzying view unfold.\nDinner awaits a tale in flavors bold.\n\n**Day Two: Imperial Grandeur and Sacred Groves**\n\nTo the Imperial Palace we shall now stride.\nA glimpse of history where emperors reside.\nMeiji Jingu's peace a tranquil scene.\nPrayers and reverence forever keen.\nHarajuku's fashion a vibrant sight.\nYouthful spirits bathed in neon light.\n\n**Day Three: Culture's Embrace in Asakusa's Heart**\n\nAsakusa's temple Senso-ji grand and old.\nIncense smoke a story to be told.\nNakamise-dori stalls a tempting array.\nSouvenirs and treats to brighten the day.\nSumida River cruise a gentle flow.\nSkyscrapers gleam a dazzling glow.\n\n**Day Four: Hakone's Beauty Volcanic and Fair**\n\nHakone's mountains a scenic grace.\nLake Ashi's waters a mirrored space.\nVolcanic hot springs a soothing balm.\nNature's artistry a tranquil psalm.\nArt museums beckon a cultured plea.\nA day of beauty for thee to see.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Charm Ancient and Deep**\n\nBy Shinkansen's speed we swiftly roam.\nTo Kyoto's heart a welcoming home.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion dream.\nThousands of torii a vibrant gleam.\nGion's geishas a fleeting grace.\nA whispered secret in this ancient place.\n\n**Day Six: Golden Pavilion and Zen's Stillness**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a gilded sight.\nReflecting beauty in morning light.\nRyoan-ji's garden a mindful quest.\nZen's quiet wisdom puts souls at rest.\nArashiyama Bamboo Grove a verdant maze.\nSunlight filters in ethereal haze.\n\n**Day Seven: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey where deer roam free.\nTodai-ji's temple a sight to see.\nGreat Buddha's presence a peaceful might.\nAncient history bathed in golden light.\nKasuga Taisha lanterns a gentle glow.\nPrayers and wishes softly flow.\n\n**Day Eight: Osaka's Delights Culinary and Bold**\n\nOsaka's kitchens a foodie's delight.\nDotonbori's lights a dazzling night.\nTakoyaki and okonomiyaki a taste divine.\nCulinary adventures truly shine.\nOsaka Castle stands proud and tall.\nA city vibrant answering beauty's call.\n\n**Day Nine: Return to Tokyo and Farewell**\n\nBack to Tokyo's embrace we turn.\nMemories gathered lessons learned.\nShopping for treasures a final spree.\nA fond farewell for thee and me.\nTo Narita's gate thy journey ends.\nUntil we meet again dear friends.\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.011765611357986927}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5722140073776245}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9360458254814148}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.0013153243344277143}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.06904146075248718}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -1.625551700592041}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.27467110753059387}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.08894381672143936}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00020990552729927003}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.09638943523168564}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.12364227324724197}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.04463106766343117}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.285430371761322}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.3252663314342499}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.009871711023151875}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.48966914415359497}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.2920592725276947}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.005486786365509033}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.001515550771728158}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.10065241158008575}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.0023016647901386023}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -9.179073458653875e-06}, {